    "size": "sm"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "16302a39-d647-4671-b6f3-144ab2aab3c3",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.prose",
   "parent_uuid": "27f5b80c-d0e7-4594-9f10-957853273b99",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "body": "<p>Meridian Airport has two terminals, linked by a covered walkway. It takes about 5 minutes to walk between them, step-free all the way. Each terminal has its own check-in, security and gates, so check which one your airline uses.</p>"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "32539a8f-12c9-4860-8ba6-a2c5a6e507b5",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.group",
   "parent_uuid": "f6021a8f-4c84-4650-82f6-970841baa38f",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "layout": "stack"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "f6fe2d94-cfff-4848-a54f-23e5a25b5a70",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.prose",
   "parent_uuid": "32539a8f-12c9-4860-8ba6-a2c5a6e507b5",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "body": "<h3>Terminal 1</h3>\n<p>Meridian Air flies from Terminal 1.</p>"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "099a0487-3cda-4aef-8ab3-14c1216ba580",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.group",
   "parent_uuid": "32539a8f-12c9-4860-8ba6-a2c5a6e507b5",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "layout": "split-main-aside"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "288cb1b0-83c8-43a7-96eb-2d6f607eb9d7",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.terminal-map",
   "parent_uuid": "099a0487-3cda-4aef-8ab3-14c1216ba580",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "terminal": "terminal-1"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "1650ed42-e183-4833-b25b-79ca53eacefa",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.prose",
   "parent_uuid": "099a0487-3cda-4aef-8ab3-14c1216ba580",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "body": "<ul><li>The railway station is one level below check-in. Lifts and escalators come up next to zone A.</li><li>Zone C is for special assistance, oversized bags and anyone who needs more time.</li><li>After security, gates 1 to 10 are a 4-minute walk and gates 11 to 19 are up to 10 minutes.</li><li>The lost property office is in the arrivals hall, next to the taxi rank.</li></ul>"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "0de17483-9b4f-4de7-841e-31f43cc331cd",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.group",
   "parent_uuid": "f6021a8f-4c84-4650-82f6-970841baa38f",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "layout": "stack"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "25590d7e-1b04-4bed-a0f6-83588093354e",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.prose",
   "parent_uuid": "0de17483-9b4f-4de7-841e-31f43cc331cd",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "body": "<h3>Terminal 2</h3>\n<p>Nordvik, Azur Express and Kestrel fly from Terminal 2.</p>"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "2d607a46-f6ac-4d32-b9a9-da9992ff62dc",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.group",
   "parent_uuid": "0de17483-9b4f-4de7-841e-31f43cc331cd",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "layout": "split-main-aside"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "ef6dbc2a-8fdb-4115-a2a6-7fc6d1ab3feb",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.terminal-map",
   "parent_uuid": "2d607a46-f6ac-4d32-b9a9-da9992ff62dc",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "terminal": "terminal-2"
   }
  },
  {
   "uuid": "fc2dbcc5-0782-4fa2-a6ea-e80de6224caa",
   "component_id": "sdc.meridian.prose",
   "parent_uuid": "2d607a46-f6ac-4d32-b9a9-da9992ff62dc",
   "slot": "parts",
   "inputs": {
    "body": "<ul><li>Zone D is Nordvik, zone E is Azur Express and zone F is Kestrel. Special assistance is at zone D.</li><li>After security, gates 20 to 29 are a 5-minute walk. Gates 30 to 38 can take up to 15 minutes.</li><li>The coach station is outside the arrivals hall, at the far end from the walkway.</li></ul>"
   }
  },
  {
